    "created_at": "2025-07-28T22:27:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-28T22:27:10Z",
    "body": "Almost every preset hacks around some form of segment module templating, should this be first-class?\n\nThe powerline themes (eg. https://starship.rs/presets/pastel-powerline) all leak extra prompt separators when the modules that would be shown are empty, and a few of the others override every single module's format to override what could be a segment post-processing set (eg. https://starship.rs/presets/bracketed-segments).\n\nThese are all the similar issues I found:\n- https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/528\n- https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/3303\n- https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/5812\n- https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/6017\n- https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/6218\n- https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/6558",
    "author_association": "NONE",
